* Variable strains

1C-
1M = 5+ major, M shown
1oM = other major, needs M bound
1m = 3+ minor
1om = other minor, needs m bound
1X = any new suit
1Y = next new suit above X
1Z = highest new suit
1x = lowercase x (accepted extension)
1CD = clubs or diamonds (literal, no binding)
2red = hearts or diamonds
2black = clubs or spades
